 "summary": "An amber caution: two air data references have failed. Normal law is lost (alternate law, protections lost), AP, FD and A/THR are lost, and one side loses air data unless ADR 3 can replace it. With ADR 1+2 failed, set AIR DATA to CAPT 3, turn the failed ADRs OFF and select FLAPS 1 only below the VFE of CONF 1+F. With ADR 1+3 failed, the gear cannot retract and must be extended by gravity. Land in CONF 3 at VREF + 10 kt; the law becomes DIRECT when the gear goes down.",
