  {
   "text": "With a triple ADR failure, the NAV ADR 1+2+3 FAULT procedure has all three ADRs switched OFF, to replace the PFD speed scale and altitude by the BUSS and GPS altitude.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
